OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry day today with a mix of
OL,6,Fsunshine and fair weather cloud. The
OL,7,Fsunshine also becoming rather hazy at
OL,8,Ftimes. Feeling hot with light winds.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FA dry and fine evening to
OL,11,Fcome with plenty of late sunshine.
OL,12,FOvernight some cloud will build,
OL,13,Fespecially across the north and west
OL,14,Fof the region. A rather warm night.
OL,15,
OL,16,CMonday:FA bright start but skies
OL,17,Fbecoming rather cloudy throughout the
OL,18,Fmorning. Remaining dry throughout
OL,19,Fthough with sunshine returning later.
OL,20,FFeeling a little cooler but still warm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
